# Lease secrets

The proof that a request comes from the worker a lease was granted to. A lease's
fencing token is a sequence number, and a contributor's id is public (the
leaderboard shows it), so neither can authenticate a heartbeat or an attempt. The
coordinator therefore hands each lease a secret: an HMAC-SHA-256 of the unit and
its token under the coordinator's lease key. It stores nothing — the secret is
recomputed when a request presents it — and a request whose secret does not match
is refused like any stale lease.

The lease key is derived from key material the coordinator already holds in
secret (its database password, or `MACSAD_LEASE_KEY_FILE` when set), under a label
of its own, so the key is stable across restarts and never stored anywhere.

## Note
The lease key derived from secret key material.

## To leaseKeyFrom (material: Text) -> Text:
    Return macHex(material, "macsad/coordinator/lease-key/v1").

## Note
The secret of the lease on `unitId` under `token`.

## To leaseSecret (key: Text, unitId: Text, token: Int) -> Text:
    Return macHex(key, unitId + "\n" + "{token}").

## Note
Whether a presented secret is the lease's, compared in constant time.

## To leaseSecretValid (key: Text, unitId: Text, token: Int, presented: Text) -> Bool:
    Return sameTextInConstantTime(leaseSecret(key, unitId, token), presented).

## Test: lease secrets are bound to their unit and token

Let key be leaseKeyFrom("0123456789abcdef").
Let s be leaseSecret(key, "u-1", 7).
Expect that length of s is equal to 64.
Expect that leaseSecretValid(key, "u-1", 7, s) is equal to true.
Expect that leaseSecretValid(key, "u-2", 7, s) is equal to false.
Expect that leaseSecretValid(leaseKeyFrom("another key"), "u-1", 7, s) is equal to false.
Expect that leaseSecretValid(key, "u-1", 7, "") is equal to false.

## Test: lease keys differ from their material

Expect that leaseKeyFrom("pw") is not equal to "pw".
Expect that leaseKeyFrom("pw") is equal to leaseKeyFrom("pw").

## Test: lease secrets refuse a later token

For all booleans later:
    Let key be leaseKeyFrom("material").
    Let mutable token be 7.
    If later:
        Set token to 8.
    Expect that leaseSecretValid(key, "u-1", token, leaseSecret(key, "u-1", 7)) is equal to (later is equal to false).
